---
/* Closing privacy-policy teaser. Identical on the homepage and about page. */
---

<section class="policy-notice-section" id="privacy-policy" aria-labelledby="privacy-notice-heading">
  <div class="wrap policy-notice">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy and data protection</p>
    <h2 id="privacy-notice-heading">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      Learn how BSG DataWorks handles contributor and website-visitor data, including
      optional analytics consent, international transfers, data retention, and privacy
      enquiries.
    </p>
    <a class="policy-read-link" href="/privacy-policy">Read the full Privacy Policy</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .policy-notice-section {
    padding: 56px 0;
    background: #F4F8F4;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .policy-notice { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center }
  .policy-notice h2 { margin: 8px 0 12px; font-family: var(--display) }
  .policy-notice p { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 18px; color: #4C5A51 }
  .policy-read-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 11px 16px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .policy-read-link:hover { background: var(--green); color: #fff; text-decoration: none }
</style>
